 "source_instruction": "i need a fashionable zdfer polo with a slim fit in the green color.",
 "query": "I swung by the community farmers\u2019 market on my walk over here this morning, and the air smelled so good from the booth selling warm cinnamon sugar apple cider donuts that I had to stop and grab a paper bag of three. The old guy running the stand noticed my scuffed-up vintage skateboard propped against his table and ended up gifting me an extra donut, saying he used to skate the same downtown creek-side paths back when he was my age in the 90s. I sat on a weathered wooden bench for ten minutes people-watching, watching a group of tiny kids chase a fluffy golden retriever that had stolen a whole sugar cookie right off its owner\u2019s picnic blanket, and it made the whole gray, drizzly morning feel way cozier than I thought it would. Hey, I\u2019m looking through the men\u2019s henleys section right now and I need one with a retro graphic print, slim fit, in the 112-green color, and it also has to have a built-in thumb hole cuff on the sleeves. I don\u2019t want anything over a reasonable price point, I\u2019m not trying to drop too much cash on a casual top right now. I tried sorting through the first page already but most of the options are either too baggy or the wrong shade, so I\u2019m hoping you can point me to the right pick that checks all those boxes.",
